      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To initiate the computer repair process, begin by examining the hardware."
      ],
      "justification": "Initiates the process and captures the first two action steps described in the opening unit."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the hardware has been checked, proceed with repairing any issues that were identified."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly corresponds to the step of repairing identified issues."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After the necessary repairs have been made, conclude the hardware inspection."
      ],
      "justification": "Maps to the explicit instruction to conclude the inspection after the initial repairs."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Following the completion of the repair process, it is important to test the functionality of the system."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the testing step that follows the repairs."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n7",
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the test results indicate that everything is functioning properly, then the hardware inspection process can be concluded."
      ],
      "justification": "Correctly models the positive branch: the XOR gateway splits the flow, the guard represents the 'functioning properly' condition (abstracted to v1='Yes'), and the process concludes."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n8",
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if the test results indicate that there are still issues, then further hardware repairs are required."
      ],
      "justification": "Correctly models the negative branch: the guard represents the 'still issues' condition (abstracted to v1='No'), leading to further repairs."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once these additional repairs have been made, the hardware inspection process can be concluded."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the final conclusion step after additional repairs are completed."
    }
  ],
